{"unit_id":"omdsh-dev__dsh-ernie-image#card-zh","repo":"omdsh-dev/dsh-ernie-image","commit":"4fa74b191bb7fae49c2992383cdbe1fe4414dc4e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ernie-image（DSH Web 插件）：通过百度 AI Studio 的 ERNIE-Image-Turbo 按文字描述生成 PNG 图像。它向 DSH 注册 ernie_generate_image 和 ernie_image_test 工具，并在 Web 设置中提供密钥与默认参数配置卡，以及可输入提示词、选择尺寸和张数的生成画廊。画廊支持预览、下载、同 seed 重生成、换 seed 生成变体，并可把图片插入当前会话；生成结果也保存为会话附件和本地文件。适合需要在 DSH 会话中创作并继续处理图像的用户；需要百度 AI Studio 访问令牌。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:21","src/tools.ts:156","src/tools.ts:247","src/tools.ts:100","src/ernie.ts:55","src/image-store.ts:30","src/rpc.ts:44","src/client/index.ts:46","src/client/ErnieCard.tsx:45","src/client/ErniePanel.tsx:46","src/credentials.ts:13"]}
